  stages:
  - instruction: 'Capture the two unclaimed cities!


      Press ''end turn'' if
      you''ve run out of actions.'
    condition: 0
    targetCount: 3
  - instruction: 'Great work!


      Click on a tile next to your city to create
      a neuron.


      Build neurons to connect all your cities.'
